-- Content region left/top in LOCAL window px (M.side/M.top). Uses the OUTER
-- holeL/holeT (a previous `local holeL, holeT` here SHADOWED them, so the hole
-- never reached glassVars and the shader content region never appeared).
function Engine.setContentHole(l, t)
    if not fxBody then return end
    if holeL == l and holeT == t then return end
    holeL, holeT = l, t
    markFxDirty()
